{"title": "limit_conn addr 2：4 个并发慢下载", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "limit_conn_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=addr:10m;"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "limit_conn addr 2; limit_rate 20k;"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "200KB 文件被拖成约 10 秒下载，4 条连接真实并存"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sw \"1:%{http_code} \" -o /dev/null localhost/big.bin &"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sw \"2:%{http_code} \" -o /dev/null localhost/big.bin &"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sw \"3:%{http_code} \" -o /dev/null localhost/big.bin &"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sw \"4:%{http_code} \" -o /dev/null localhost/big.bin &"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "4:503 3:503 1:200 2:200"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "先建连的 1/2 占额度，3/4 被拒——并发竞争的真实表现"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx/1.31.5（docker nginx:alpine 容器）"}
]}
